        "valueString": "Patient reports mildly itchy red patches on the upper chest and upper back for approximately 10–14 days, with mild intermittent pruritus worse with heat and sweat. OTC aloe gives partial relief. No blistering, skin breakdown, mucosal involvement, or photosensitivity."
